# Base images of `make host-deb-check` (WP-08g, D-155), by digest of the multi-architecture index. KEY=VALUE only.
# Debian 13 "trixie" is DEBIAN_IMAGE of deploy/containers/pins.env (read from there, not repeated). Ubuntu 24.04 LTS is below; Ubuntu 26.04
# is added when the lab VMs exist. To bump: change the digest here (`curl -sI` on the registry manifest, header docker-content-digest, with
# an Accept header for the OCI index), run `make host-deb-check`. These images are used only by that opt-in check, never shipped.
UBUNTU_2404_IMAGE=docker.io/library/ubuntu:24.04@sha256:fe81560990fae86dc4743202b2cb4d3df98d0bcf949173cecef15ce1127ef852
UBUNTU_2604_IMAGE=docker.io/library/ubuntu:26.04@sha256:6a06111c3b0a8600feadb270aec771dc239bf407b25625f93f44ab00e11f4d3c
